@startuml
title Rebar AutoDim — System Context

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Structural Engineer" as User

rectangle "Autodesk Revit 2025" as Revit {

    rectangle "Active View" as View
    rectangle "Area Reinforcement" as Area
    rectangle "Structural Grids" as Grids
    rectangle "Native Annotations" as Annotations

    rectangle "Rebar AutoDim" as Plugin
}

User --> Plugin : Run command

Plugin --> View : Read active view context
Plugin --> Area : Read visible reinforcement geometry
Plugin --> Grids : Read structural references

Plugin --> Annotations : Create / regenerate dimensions\nand supporting detail geometry

User --> Annotations : Review result

Plugin -[hidden]-> Area

note right of Plugin
Processes supported rectangular
Area Reinforcement zones
on the active view.
end note

note bottom of Area
Source reinforcement geometry
is not modified.
end note

@enduml